flowchart LR
  A[PR opened / pushed] --> B[Install with lockfile]
  B --> C[Lint + typecheck + format check]
  C --> D[Unit tests]
  D --> E[next build]
  E --> F[Playwright e2e + axe]
  F --> G[npm audit high]
  A --> P[Vercel preview deploy]
  P --> L[Lighthouse CI on preview]
  G --> M{All green?}
  L --> M
  M -- No --> X[Block merge]
  M -- Yes --> Y[Merge to main]
  Y --> Z[Vercel production deploy]
  Z --> S[Post-deploy smoke test]
